<title>JAPAN: Tobishima bid-only on restructuring report.</title>
<headline>Tobishima bid-only on restructuring report.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tobishima Corp shares were bid-only in Friday morning trade, supported by a newspaper report that the firm and Fuji Bank Ltd had agreed on a new restructuring plan for Tobishima, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price was bid-only at 431 yen at 0053 GMT against its Thursday close at 416 yen.</p>
<p>Fuji Bank said on Friday that it knew Tobishima, which is burdened by property-related debts, was forming a new restructuring plan but did not know any details.</p>
<p>A Tobishima spokesman declined to comment on the report.</p>
</text>
